# 138 - Death Knight Level 1 Scaling

## Status
- Created: 2026-04-02
- Phase: 2
- Priority: Medium
- **Status: IMPLEMENTED** (pending testing)

## Current Behavior
- Death knights start at level 1 with basic abilities (Blood Presence, Icy Touch)
- Additional abilities learned from trainers at levels 4, 6, 8, 10, 12, 14, 16, 18, 20
- DK starting quests auto-completed so players can leave Ebon Hold immediately
- Starting gear: Worn Greatsword (level 1 two-handed sword)

## Intended Behavior
- Death knights can start at level 1 like other classes ✓
- DK abilities scaled to be roughly equivalent to other classes at each level ✓
- Damage, healing, and resource costs balanced for low-level play (uses base spell ranks)
- Retains DK flavor (runes, runic power, diseases) but at appropriate power level ✓

