**Removed abilities:**
- Death Grip - too powerful/unique for low levels
- Path of Frost - unnecessary utility
- Mind Freeze - paladins don't get interrupt, neither should DKs
- Icebound Fortitude - defensive CD moved out to keep kit streamlined

**Design rationale:**
- Compared to paladins (plate class with no interrupt)
- Blood Strike at level 1 as melee opener, diseases from trainers
- All presences at level 10 for role choice
- Death Strike at 8 enables tanking early (before presences)
- Pestilence + Blood Boil at 12 together (disease synergy)
- Horn of Winter at 16 as late utility buff
- Death and Decay at 18 (paladin gets Consecration at 20)
- Death Coil provides spellpower-based unholy option

